 Based on the provided JSON structure, the names of two animals that are classified as endangered are "polar bear" and "tiger". Here's an example of how you can extract this information using JavaScript:
```javascript
const jsonData = {
  "animals": [
    {
      "name": "polar bear",
      "status": "endangered"
      // other properties...
    },
    {
      "name": "tiger",
      "status": "endangered"
