    "PS1_NON_INTERACTIVE" = "1"
  }
}
```

Replace `C:/path/to/your/example.ps1` with the actual path to your PowerShell script. Make sure PowerShell Core is installed on your system where Terraform runs.

This method sets the `PS1_NON_INTERACTIVE` environment variable to '1' to prevent PowerShell from showing any interactive prompts. Instead, it will take the provided input from the script parameters.

Remember, this method bypasses PowerShell's execution policy for security reasons. Use it only in trusted environments.

